    "revealParentClueId": "",
    "truth": "This is an office break room. Maya's lunch has been stolen. Ryan is closest to the fridge, Emma is by the microwave, Lucas is by the counter, Zoe is by the sink, Liam is by the coffee machine, Nina is by the water cooler, Noah is near the door, and Ava is near the trash bin. Noah stole Maya's lunch and joined the others pretending to search for it.",
