      "imageBrief": "Office break room after the lunch thief is exposed. Noah looks sweaty near the door while a food wrapper or bag marked MAYA is visible with him. Maya looks angry at Noah. Ava, who had been watching Maya, now looks shocked toward Noah. The rest of the coworkers realize he had been helping them search for the lunch he stole.",
      "endingLine": "He even helped search for it",
